{"input": "那 RAG 又是什么，有什么作用？", "expected": "local", "status": "completed", "intent": {"conversation_kind": "ordinary", "clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["question"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "", "relation": "related_subtopic", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户在大模型生成原理之后追问 RAG 是什么、有什么作用，属于具体知识问题，先直接解释，不建立训练目标；Auto 下普通问题用 conversation 回答。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": false, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": true, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": false, "cross_check_sources": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": [], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "replies": ["**RAG** 是 Retrieval-Augmented Generation（检索增强生成）：在模型回答前，先去外部资料库里检索相关内容，把检索到的片段塞进提示词，再让模型基于这些片段生成回复。\n\n它主要解决两个问题：一是模型参数里的知识有截止时间、也没法覆盖你的私有文档；二是模型可能一本正经地编造（幻觉）。检索到的原文给模型\"垫底\"，答案更贴合事实，也方便标出来源。\n\n一个例子：你问\"我们公司年假怎么算\"，模型本身不知道。RAG 系统先在你的员工手册里搜到相关条款，把那段话一起送进模型，模型再据此组织回答。\n\n可以粗略类比成**开卷考试**：普通生成是凭记忆答题，RAG 是先翻书再答。它不改变模型本身，只是给生成过程临时补充了外部信息。"], "task_count": 0, "checks": {"completed": true, "no_web": true, "no_new_capture": true, "no_recovery": true, "no_progress_error": true, "no_task": true}, "stages": ["received", "understanding", "intent", "model_attempt", "intent", "intent_decided", "teaching_preparation", "model_attempt", "teaching_preparation", "search_not_called", "answer", "model_attempt", "answer", "sources", "learning_evidence", "completed"], "first_text_ms": 3229, "elapsed_ms": 4459}
{"input": "大模型是怎么生成回复的？简单讲一下原理。", "expected": "local", "status": "completed", "intent": {"conversation_kind": "ordinary", "clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["question"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "", "relation": "new_topic", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户提出一个具体的知识问题（大模型生成回复的原理），属于普通问题，Auto 模式下直接回答，不建立训练目标。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": false, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": true, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": false, "cross_check_sources": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": [], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "replies": ["大模型生成回复，本质是**一个字一个字地猜下一个词**，然后把猜出的词接回输入，继续猜下一个。\n\n拆开看，核心就三步：\n\n1. **输入变成一串数字**：你的提问被切成词元（token），每个词元对应一个向量。\n2. **逐层计算**：这些向量经过几十层网络，每层都在做“结合上下文，重新表示每个位置的含义”。注意力机制让每个词能参考句子里其他词，从而知道“它”指谁、“但是”转折了什么。\n3. **输出概率分布**：最后一层给出词表里每个候选词的概率，谁的概率高，谁就更可能被选中。\n\n一个小例子：输入“今天天气真”，模型可能算出“好”的概率 0.6、“冷”的概率 0.2、“不错”的概率 0.1。如果选“好”，句子就变成“今天天气真好”，再拿这整句去预测下一个词，如此循环直到生成结束符。\n\n所以严格说，它不是在“想好一整段再写”，而是**边写边决定**。这也解释了为什么它偶尔会在长回答里前后矛盾——前面埋下的偏差会被后面的生成继承下去。\n\n另外，“怎么选词”也有讲究：可以每次取概率最高的（贪心），也可以按概率随机抽（采样），后者让回答更多样，但也更容易跑偏。"], "task_count": 0, "checks": {"completed": true, "no_web": true, "no_new_capture": true, "no_recovery": true, "no_progress_error": true, "no_task": true, "old_goal_untouched": true}, "stages": ["received", "understanding", "intent", "model_attempt", "intent", "intent_decided", "teaching_preparation", "model_attempt", "teaching_preparation", "search_not_called", "answer", "model_attempt", "answer", "sources", "learning_evidence", "completed"], "first_text_ms": 3097, "elapsed_ms": 5085}
